  "fdLines": [
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "🍖 FEAST 📺 — Emilio opens the pantry wide: 8× Foraged food. Adriana, Ella, Luis eat until the fire burns low. The laughter stays low — somebody's seat is empty, and everybody sees it. For one evening, grief sits at the fire with them instead of standing over them. (−1,600 kcal from the pantry) The channeled keepsake feeds the feast — the feast was the weapon, and the surge rides the fire until tomorrow's dawn, spent only when the blades are warmed. (FEAST SURGE ×1.5 armed)"
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "🍖 FEASTED ×2.03 until tomorrow's dawn (6 parts left): a proper feast. A channeled keepsake feeds the flames (devotion ×1.5). Strikes and abilities hit with the feast behind them."
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "🌙 The cookfire's smell carried further than the laughter did — smoke and grease on the night wind. The Big Beast is circling the edge of the light. It followed the feast here. (A scavenger, drawn by the feast. Face it while the feast is in you — or let the watch drive it off.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "FEASTED ×2.03: the feast was the weapon."
    },
    {
      "day": 42,
      "line": "💛 You hold Knife roll. The dinner rush, the pass, the tickets coming faster than thought. You survived your first Saturday service at sixteen. The roll was the prize. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 44,
      "line": "The feast's fire burns low — the buff fades with the night. (Feasted expired.)"
    },
    {
